 "patch": "crew_quarters",
 "//": "Story Phase 13: the old sleeping quarters, reopened (chapter 129). The bedding as the crew left it, yellowed and growling (the kitten-roar pillow on the starboard cot, 16,6); judged (the cots, the hammocks, and the middle port footlocker, 4,8, with a pillowcase sticking out of it), piled (11,8), thrown into the storm and sent back folded; stuffed into the linen locker in the north wall (11,3) and nailed shut (DO NOT OPEN. IT GROWLS.). Then remade in toy sashes (131). The Fan Mega-Pack (12,8, 132) and five cardboard Ancient Stenchmasters on decor slots (the player chooses each one's spot; saved as story values). The Build-Your-Own S.E.S. on the barrel table (10,6, 133): the cable runs from it to the ladder; Stench-O-Vision's vent makes a small, mild fume source round it (9-11, 5-7) while it's open. The rant (138); the delirium (139-141): a sack of beans by the door (9,5), a cask of Frog Grog (16,12), the sauce on the shelf (5,3). The haze and the Phase 8 cloud lift once the bedding's out; the locker keeps growling.",
